# Unit test rules

When creating or modifying tests, follow the mockery pattern in @docs/code-guidelines.md (**Unit testing with mockery**) — `.mockery.yml`, `mocks.NewX(t)`, `.On(...)`, `require` for setup, `assert` for behavior.

Default to unit tests with mocked ports. Do not hit Postgres or a running server. Add `//go:build integration` only when the test cannot work without real infrastructure.

See @AGENTS.md **Testing** for commands (`go test ./...`, regenerate mocks with `mockery`).
